# Shared ignore rules for the monorepo

# Java / Maven
**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# Node / Angular
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/cache/
**/coverage/
**/.sass-cache/

# Logs and temporary files
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

data/Przygotowanie
docker-compose/docker
.env
notatki.txt